---
description: Design taste, design system and motion rules for UI work
globs: src/**/*.astro, src/**/*.ts, src/**/*.tsx, src/**/*.css, tailwind.config.*
alwaysApply: false
---

**Owner taste (required)**
- Organization and clear flow first.
- Smooth rounded corners, pill buttons and chips, gradients that separate sections from the background.
- Visible, smooth animations on navigation (Astro View Transitions) and section reveals.
- Characterful display font + clean body font. Never default system fonts.
- Avoid: sharp flat boxes, no section separation, generic purple-gradient AI look, repeated identical card grids, random glass.

**System**
- Use tokens only (Tailwind theme + CSS vars): color roles, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation, z, motion durations/easings.
- Primitives: Button (pill), Chip, ProjectCard, Section, Header/Nav, Footer, Logo, Icon. Every state: hover, focus-visible, active, selected, disabled.
- Each ProjectCard uses its accent color from `projects.json`.

**Motion**
- Purposeful, never blocks content. No scroll hijacking, custom cursors or hover-only info.
- Instant feedback on hover/press/focus.
- `prefers-reduced-motion` → real reduced/static version. Pause offscreen animation; clean up observers/listeners.

**A11y/perf**
- WCAG 2.2 AA, check contrast on gradients, visible focus, 24px+ targets, keyboard-operable filters and menu.
- Budgets: JS ≤ 60 KB gz/page, ≤ 2 font families ≤ 120 KB, hero media ≤ 200 KB, CLS ≈ 0. Lighthouse ≥ 90 (mobile, prod build).
